---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="container about-container">
    <div class="about-visual">
      <div class="about-image-main">
        <div class="about-image-placeholder">
          <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#4BA69D" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path>
            <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline>
          </svg>
          <p>Our Modern Facility</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-experience-badge">
        <span class="exp-number">25+</span>
        <span class="exp-text">Years Serving<br>O'Fallon</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-content">
      <span class="section-tag">About Us</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">More Than a Dental Clinic &mdash; Partners in Your Smile Journey</h2>
      <p class="about-text">
        At Lake Pointe Dental Group, you gain more than just dental care &mdash; you receive complete wellness support tailored to your needs. Our experienced team takes the time to understand your health journey and create personalized treatment plans.
      </p>
      <div class="about-features">
        <div class="about-feature">
          <div class="feature-check">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Patient-Centered Approach</strong>
            <p>Every procedure is explained thoroughly to your satisfaction, regardless of how simple or complex.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-feature">
          <div class="feature-check">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>State-of-the-Art Technology</strong>
            <p>Modern equipment and techniques for the most gentle, safe, and effective treatments possible.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-feature">
          <div class="feature-check">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>All Ages Welcome</strong>
            <p>From children to seniors, our dentists are experienced working with patients of every age group.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
        Get to Know Us
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
